
# type(scope): description        ← 72 chars, imperative, no full stop
#
#   feat  fix  docs  style  refactor  perf  test  build  ci  chore  revert
#   Add ! before the colon for a breaking change: feat(memory)!: ...
#
#   feat(integrations): add Tududi
#   fix(konzol): mobile UI overflow
#   fix(security): re-check admin group on every mutating request
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Body: why, not what. The diff already says what changed.
#
# Worth writing down:
#   - the reason, especially if the change looks odd out of context
#   - what you traded away, and what would justify revisiting it
#   - what you verified, and what you did NOT verify
#   - alternatives you rejected, so nobody re-treads that ground
#
# Leave the body out only when there is genuinely nothing to say.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Footers:
#   BREAKING CHANGE: <what breaks and what to do about it>
#   Refs: #123
#
